IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CLAWVM-STRESS.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SCENARIO-ID         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BUDGET-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TURNS               PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 STARVATION-MISSES   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CLAWVM-STRESS.
    IF TURNS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 0 TO STARVATION-MISSES.
    IF SCENARIO-ID == 0
        IF BUDGET-TOKENS < 60
            MOVE 10 TO STARVATION-MISSES.
        END-IF.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SCENARIO-ID.
    WEIGHT 30 STARVATION-MISSES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
